 fragments. A test infrastructure producer must not run a future downstream scenario prematurely. Every fixed verification needs an actual command and cwd.\n\nField contract: verifications[].run is argv and optional cwd is repository-relative; tasks[].verify contains verification ids; tasks[].resources contains lock identities; expanded Composite entry/exit contain child task ids. Never place commands or prose in these id arrays.\n\nMinimal field examples: {\"leaf\":{\"task\":{\"id\":\"implement_cli\",\"title\":\"Implement CLI\",\"role\":\"work\",\"ownerId\":\"build-tooling\",\"write\":[\"scripts/**\"],\"dependsOn\":[],\"resources\":[\"cli:offline-precheck\"],\"verify\":[\"blackbox-suite\"],\"done\":[\"Black-box scenarios pass\"]},\"verification\":{\"id\":\"blackbox-suite\",\"run\":[\"node\",\"--test\",\"test/offline-precheck.test.mjs\"],\"cwd\":\".\"}},\"composite\":{\"parent\":{\"id\":\"ship_cli\",\"title\":\"Ship CLI\",\"role\":\"work\",\"ownerId\":\"build-tooling\",\"write\":[],\"dependsOn\":[],\"verify\":[],\"done\":[\"All child exits complete\"],\"children\":[\"implement_cli\",\"document_cli\"],\"entry\":[\"implement_cli\"],\"exit\":[\"document_cli\"],\"decomposition\":{\"status\":\"expanded\",\"kind\":\"composite\",\"outcome\":\"Shipped CLI\",\"ownerCandidates\":[\"build-tooling\"],\"unknowns\":[]}}}}\n\nplanningBindings={contract:\"DSH_PLANNING_BINDINGS_V1\",snapshotId,sourceDigest,tasks:[{taskId,tickets:[{id,revision,fragments:[]}],contracts:[{id,revision}]}]}.\n\nownerFeedbackFacts are persisted, non-blocking execution evidence. Use their report as context, but do not redefine them as plan_review obligations.\n\nReport {plan: ...} through workflow_action_submit. Do not write documents, change Registry, or create new requirements.\n\nWhen revisionBoundary is present, preserve all execution contracts outside its explicit taskIds/verificationIds. task.write, ownerId, selected source fragments, contract revisions, actual verification definitions, and recursive dependency changes count as task changes. A Ticket document revision, unrelated Owner description edit, or scope expansion alone does not change a task execution contract; the full current snapshot bindings must still be compiled accurately. An out-of-bound execution change is rejected before publication; report newly discovered obligations to the root instead of silently broadening the revision.\n\n{\"planningInput\":{\"contract\":\"DSH_PLANNING_ROLE_INPUT_V1\",\"snapshot\":{\"id\":\"snapshot-planning-finalize-e03c0ffbaed0040bb6a2748e\",\"checkpointId\":\"planning-finalize-e03c0ffbaed0040bb6a2748e\",\"projectRoot\":\"/private/var/folders/pk/4_rtp5211139hr72f5z3yv2c0000gn/T/ukr-planning-8QDWWu/project\",\"sourceDigest\":\"e16345b82292642c551f71d6e253112a717d591298103c64b79a125094204e42\",\"codeBaseline\":{\"branch\":\"main\",\"checkpointCommit\":\"ea77e5ff2660461aaf8623a3b76b1bbf74cb3e2c\",\"checkpointTree\":\"84a96593a15ad2ed92e9c6168286270c5e1866e6\",\"sourceHead\":\"5bee01ea4c83ba49dbfab4e95ec78bdf1f15cdc3\"},\"reason\":\"root main-thread planning bundle finalize\",\"parentSnapshotId\":\"snapshot-planning-finalize-3b1767157a81f34b904a1fd1\"},\"references\":{\"blocked\":[],\"contract\":\"DSH_PLANNING_REFERENCE_SET_V1\",\"ready\":[{\"segment\":{\"id\":\"source-value\"},\"ticketId\":\"TICKET-NATIVE\"}],\"spec\":{\"acceptanceCriteria\":[\"AC-NATIVE\"],\"content\":\"---\\nplanning_document: DSH_PLANNING_DOCUMENT_V1\\ndocument_kind: spec\\ndocument_id: SPEC-NATIVE\\ndocument_revision: R2\\nplanning_declaration: {\\\"id\\\":\\\"SPEC-NATIVE\\\",\\\"revision\\\":\\\"R2\\\",\\\"acceptanceCriteria\\\":[\\\"AC-NATIVE\\\"],\\\"contracts\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"source\\\",\\\"revision\\\":\\\"v1\\\"}]}\\n---\\n\\n# SPEC-NATIVE\\n\\nClarified requirement: the complete value is changed, without a partial value.\\n\",\"contracts\":[{\"id\":\"source\",\"revision\":\"v1\"}],\"id\":\"SPEC-NATIVE\",\"path\":\"docs/specs/native/spec.md\",\"revision\":\"R2\",\"sha256\":\"3620335381be42b5